---
import type { Lang } from "../../lib/i18n";
import { local } from "./shared";
import { moneyText } from "./monetization";
import "./monetization-controls.css";
interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const t = local(lang),
  m = moneyText(lang, "one-time-payment");
---

<section data-demo="one-time-payment" data-money lang={lang}>
  <header>
    <p class="eyebrow">{m.fiction}</p>
    <h2>{t("One-time payment", "일회성 결제", "買い切り")}</h2>
  </header>
  <p>{m.billing}</p>
  <ol class="months">
    <li>
      <span>{m.month} 1</span>
      <strong>30</strong>
      <span>{m.exports}: 100</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span>{m.month} 2</span>
      <strong>0</strong>
      <span>{m.exports}: 300</span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span>{m.month} 3</span>
      <strong>0</strong>
      <span>{m.exports}: 600</span>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <p class="sum">
    {m.total}: 30 + 0 + 0 = <b>30</b>
  </p>
  <p>
    {t(
      "This license covers the illustrated usage. Support, upgrades and hosted-service duration need separate terms.",
      "이 구매 권리는 예시 사용량을 포함합니다. 지원·업그레이드·호스팅 기간은 따로 정합니다.",
      "この購入権は例の利用量を含みます。サポート・更新・ホスティング期間は別に定めます。",
    )}
  </p>
  <p class="assumptions">{m.omitted}</p>
  <p data-contract-context class="contract-context">
    {t(
      "The customer pays 30 in month one and zero in months two and three despite 100, 300 and 600 exports. Access follows the example’s license; the product seller still owes whatever support the offer promises.",
      "고객은 출력 100·300·600회와 무관하게 첫 달 30, 둘째·셋째 달 0을 냅니다. 접근은 예제 이용권에 따르며 판매자는 제안한 지원을 제공할 책임이 있습니다.",
      "出力が100・300・600回でも顧客は初月に30、2・3か月目に0を払います。利用は例のライセンスに従い、販売者には提示した支援の責任が残ります。",
    )}
  </p>
</section>
<style>
  .months {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 0.7rem;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .months li {
    background: #fff;
    border-top: 4px solid #567a73;
    padding: 1rem;
  }
  .months span,
  .months strong {
    display: block;
  }
  .months strong {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
  }
  .sum {
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 1px dashed #567a73;
  }
  @container (max-width:420px) {
    .months {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .months {
    gap: 0;
    border: 3px solid #4b6848;
  }
  .months li {
    border: 0;
    border-right: 2px solid #4b6848;
    padding: 28px;
  }
  .months strong {
    font-size: 3rem;
  }
  .months li:first-child {
    border-top: 9px solid #4b6848;
  }
  .sum {
    border-block: 3px solid #4b6848;
    padding: 24px;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }
</style>
